// Vars through the build driver: counted in loops, chosen in branches, one
// for each entity of a `for` (also when the entities run on all cores).
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/vars.ent | FileCheck %s
// RUN: %ent run --parallel %S/Inputs/vars.ent | FileCheck %s

// CHECK:      free 14 walls 26 nested 118 ++++++++
